    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0732" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg626"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ecuadorean Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-31"><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 15.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your kind note of the 26th instant expressing the regret felt by your
                    Government at my inability to visit Guayaquil during the recent trip which I
                    made to South America.</p>
                <p>May I venture to ask you to be good enough to convey to your Government an
                    expression of my sincere appreciation of its courtesy and my deep regret that
                    circumstances rendered it impossible for me to visit Ecuador and to meet its
                    distinguished statesmen?</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
